<title>RUSSIA: RUSSIA LUKOIL SHARES RISE TO RECORD $27.10.</title>
<headline>RUSSIA LUKOIL SHARES RISE TO RECORD $27.10.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ordinary shares in Russia's LUKoil rose 8.8 pct to a record $27.10 on the Russian Trading System at 0805 GMT on Thursday from a $24.90 close on Wednesday. Prefs rose over 10 percent to $18.50 from $16.40.</p>
<p>Traders said interest from Western and local investors had been growing for several days, as the RTS index set records, but could not say what had triggered the aggressive buying.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
